{"suttaId":"thig5.12","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Thī","vriCode":"s0509m.mul","paras":[489,505],"vripara":"122"},"segments":{"thig5.12:0.3":"Candātherīgāthā","thig5.12:1.1":"“Duggatāhaṃ pure āsiṃ, vidhavā ca aputtikā;","thig5.12:1.3":"Vinā mittehi ñātīhi, bhattacoḷassa nādhigaṃ.","thig5.12:2.1":"“Pattaṃ daṇḍañca gaṇhitvā, bhikkhamānā kulā kulaṃ;","thig5.12:2.3":"Sītuṇhena ca ḍayhantī, satta vassāni cārihaṃ.","thig5.12:3.1":"“Bhikkhuniṃ puna disvāna, annapānassa lābhiniṃ;","thig5.12:3.3":"Upasaṅkamma avocaṃ [avociṃ (ka.)],‘pabbajjaṃ anagāriyaṃ’.","thig5.12:4.1":"“Sā ca maṃ anukampāya, pabbājesi paṭācārā;","thig5.12:4.3":"Tato maṃ ovaditvāna, paramatthe niyojayi.","thig5.12:5.1":"“Tassāhaṃ vacanaṃ sutvā, akāsiṃ anusāsaniṃ;","thig5.12:5.3":"Amogho ayyāyovādo, tevijjāmhi anāsavā”ti.","thig5.12:6.1":"… Candā therī ….","thig5.12:7.1":"Pañcakanipāto niṭṭhito."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
